$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2floop  LOC_AFTER=?

* The loop rule of the machine layer at a test label with a per-iteration cost family: the test ` branch C0 ( goto B0 ) ( goto E ) ` at ` A ` succeeds on the class ` ( N ` i ) ` for ` i < R ` (~ tm2lbrt ), the body runs from ` B0 ` back to ` A ` within ` ( U ` i ) ` steps (a hypothesis triple over the stack family ` ( P ` i ) ` ), and the test fails on ` ( N ` R ) ` (~ tm2fbrg ); the run is ~ tm2hitsum over the family of test-label configurations.  Lean: ` Frag.loop_runs' ` (PrimList.lean) and ` Frag.loop_runs_budget ` (PrimTD.lean) in the Sigma form.

